      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَدًا</span></b> , (S, K,) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصًا</span> (S) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَفًا</span>, (TA,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَدٌ</span></b> ,
